Search-R1 Learning is a code-only educational project.

The Search-R1 project (https://github.com/PeterGriffinJin/Search-R1) informs the
prompt, tool protocol, reward conventions and experimental comparisons.
The GRPO integration targets the external verl v0.6.1 project
(https://github.com/volcengine/verl). The full upstream framework is not bundled.

Reference evaluator code, its exact source metadata and license notices are
preserved in tests/fixtures/official_qa_metrics/.

Public datasets, Wikipedia, model weights, retrieval indexes and generated
artifacts are not distributed here. Obtain them separately from their respective
publishers and follow their applicable terms and licenses.
